@startuml offering-autonomy-authority-boundary
title Offering Autonomy Authority Boundary ; per ADR-ES-019 section 5 + section 7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Autonomous Offering" as AO
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraints" as Con
class "Governance" as Gov
class "Escalation" as Esc

AO --> Auth : operates-within
AO --> Pol : governed-by
AO --> Con : constrained-by
AO --> Gov : operates-within
AO --> Esc : escalates-to

note bottom of AO
  Per ADR-ES-019 section 5 + section 7, autonomous behavior
  is bounded by authority, policy, constraints, governance.
  Escalation is first-class. Human participation remains valid.
  Foundational Dependency Gate documented per ADR-ES-019 section 2.
end note

@enduml
